        <mxCell id="a1" value="1. System Admin definisikan workflow template per modul — steps, mode SEQUENTIAL/PARALLEL, approver roles, SLA, restart policy (versioned)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EFF6FF;strokeColor=#3B82F6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
